# Byte-compiled / cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Large / regenerable data artifacts (see docs/DATA_SOURCES.md to reproduce)
tools/*.jar
data/synthea/
data/synthea_s2/
third_party/

# Keep the small derived patient index so cases stay interpretable
!data/patient_index.json

# 2026-08-24: outputs/ was in this list before the repo was ever initialised.
# It is now TRACKED on purpose. It is only 973 KB over 237 files, and for VMAG
# the eval outputs ARE the measurement - excluding them would mean the backup
# does not hold the results. Revert this line if outputs/ ever gets large.

# API keys pasted in by hand. Never committed - the free-tier keys are still
# credentials, and a leaked one is someone else's quota and someone else's bill.
# Deliberately NOT named after any provider: an ignore rule that enumerates
# which services are in use is itself a disclosure (learned 2026-08-24).
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
